{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A new Battle Royale Game, I have played every battle royale game, and honestly, I wanted to make one myself and tailor it completely for the players, so I did. I apologize as I am the only one working on the game, my wife is pregnant and I also have a full-time job, I am releasing this in hopes to get the funds to complete this game in its entirety withing the next year or two years. I will focus heavily on all player feedback.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3538920?t=1743544013","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3538920?t=1743544013","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538920/03cc5e9677ff57d44fa24ae32acb70d99a4eecf6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743544013","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538920/03cc5e9677ff57d44fa24ae32acb70d99a4eecf6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743544013","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"shooting and gun violence"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A new Battle Royale Game, I have played every battle royale game, and honestly, I wanted to make one myself and tailor it completely for the players, so I did. I apologize as I am the only one working on the game, my wife is pregnant and I also have a full-time job, I am releasing this in hopes to get the funds to complete this game in its entirety withing the next year or two years. I will focus heavily on all player feedback.</p>","developers":["Steven Bead